// Port-only (HD weather): the composite (composite.pshader) under neither rain, falling snow nor settled snow: built
// without the rain's wet look, the weather's veil (the rain's or the snow's) and the snow's cover, which leave a
// colour as it is without them, so its pixels don't pay for the registers their reads take. MCVulkanPresenter draws
// with it whenever none shows.

#define COMPOSITE_WEATHER 0
#include "composite.pshader"
